What comes from them, and what was changed:

- custom_components/hydrao/protocol.py: decoding of the Bluetooth data,
  ported from Hydrao-Ble-Raspberry and adapted to Home Assistant.
- The connection steps, the LED threshold rules and colors and the soaping
  break follow Hydrao-Eco. They were written again in Python.
- icon.png and custom_components/hydrao/brand/icon*.png: the icon of the
  Hydrao-Eco app (assets/icon/icon.png), resized.
- custom_components/hydrao/brand/logo*.png: the Hydrao logo of the
  Hydrao-Eco app (assets/splashscreen/splashscreen_branding.png), placed on
  the blue background of the app and resized.

